Lightfast CLI authentication components

The auth contract, PKCE, OAuth state, loopback callback, token client and
NativeAuthError implementation and their associated tests were relocated
from Lightfast's private @repo/native-auth-contract and @repo/native-auth-node
packages (version 0.1.0), licensed under Apache-2.0.

These components remain Apache-2.0 licensed; see LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.
The relocation changes module paths and removes package barrels and unused
native RPC and unconsumed request-schema/type exports. The surrounding Lightfast CLI remains MIT licensed; see LICENSE.
